**Known for**: suckless.org

Laslo is the first chair of the suckless board of directors, alongside Jan
Klemkow and Anselm R Garbe. He, and many members of suckless, are covert
Neo-Nazis. In their 2017 hackathon, hosted in Germany and attended mostly by
Germans, they hosted a torchlit march, which in Germany is of course
historically coded as a Nazi action.[[source]][1][[source]][2] Laslo posted on
Lobsters about it at some length, calling the backlash to this event "cultural
marxism" (a common dog-whistle for "the Jews").[[source]][3]

Laslo pushed suckless to add a statement clarifying the intent of the torchlit
march, and another denouncing fascism and Nazism, and his changes were forcibly
reverted by other suckless members. Make of that what you will.

They all do a decent job of maintaining plausible deniability, but it falls
apart on closer inspection.

